features/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/final-review.md.log:1760:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3019:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2105:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:189:| T03 | Euler | V−E+F == 2 | `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当の検証 |
